&trans  &trans                         &trans                         &trans                         &trans                         &trans                                                          &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans                &trans         &trans             &trans             &trans               &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans                         &kp LS(LC(TAB))                &kp LC(W)                      &kp LC(TAB)                    &kp LC(T)                                                       &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans                &trans         &kp LS(LEFT)       &mt LG(UP) UP      &kp LS(RIGHT)        &trans  &trans
