&trans  &kp LA(NUMBER_1)               &kp LA(NUMBER_2)               &kp LA(NUMBER_3)               &kp LA(NUMBER_4)               &trans                         &trans                           &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans      &trans         &kp LG(LS(LEFT))   &trans             &kp LG(LS(RIGHT))    &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans                                                        &trans                         &trans                         &trans                         &trans                                                             &mt LA(LC(DELETE)) DELETE  &kp LS(SPACE)                                                                     &trans
            >;
        };

