&trans  &trans           &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_7  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_8  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_9  &num_eisu KP_SLASH               &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans            &trans  &trans           &trans     &trans       &trans   &trans
&trans  &trans           &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_4  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_5  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_6  &num_eisu KP_MULTIPLY            &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans            &trans  &kp LS(LC(TAB))  &kp LC(W)  &kp LC(TAB)  &trans   &trans
&trans  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_0  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_1  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_2  &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_3  &num_eisu KP_MINUS     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &kp F7           &kp F8     &kp F9       &kp F10  &trans
&trans  &trans           &num_eisu KP_NUMBER_0  &type_00         &num_eisu KP_DOT       &num_eisu KP_PLUS      &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans           &trans     &trans       &trans   &trans
&trans  &trans                            &trans           &trans           &trans           &kp LS(TAB)                                &trans  &trans                                                    &trans
            >;
